{"id":"4937f229fe78bb22","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md","title":"Outer Measure","display":"df-outer-measure — Outer Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-outer-measure","aliases":["58-df-outer-measure","Outer Measure","58-df-zfc-measure2-outer-measure","58-df-zfc-measure5-outer-measure","58-df-zfc-measure6-outer-measure","58-df-zfc-measure9-outer-measure"],"display":"df-outer-measure — Outer Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-outer-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-outer-measure</span><span>Outer Measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure2-outer-measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure5-outer-measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure6-outer-measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure9-outer-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-outer-measure — Outer Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mu^*\\in\\mathbf V\">\\(X,\\mu^*\\in\\mathbf V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,\\infty]\\coloneqq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\([0,\\infty]\\coloneqq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_+\\coloneqq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(E_+\\coloneqq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\\notin\\mathbb R\">\\(\\infty\\notin\\mathbb R\\)</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_+\">\\(E_+\\)</span> 上，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\leq b\\leftrightarrow(b=\\infty\\lor(a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land a\\leq_{\\mathbb R}b))\">\\(a\\leq b\\leftrightarrow(b=\\infty\\lor(a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land a\\leq_{\\mathbb R}b))\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\oplus b\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a+_{\\mathbb R}b,&amp;a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\\\\\infty,&amp;a=\\infty\\lor b=\\infty.\\end{cases}\">\\(a\\oplus b\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a+_{\\mathbb R}b,&amp;a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\\\\\infty,&amp;a=\\infty\\lor b=\\infty.\\end{cases}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in E_+^\\omega\">\\(u\\in E_+^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_u\">\\(p_u\\)</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(p_u,\\omega,E_+)\\land p_u(0)=0\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(n+1)=p_u(n)\\oplus u(n))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(p_u,\\omega,E_+)\\land p_u(0)=0\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(n+1)=p_u(n)\\oplus u(n))\\)</span> 的唯一函数图。可数和是下式唯一确定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}u(n)=r\\leftrightarrow r\\in E_+\\land[\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq r)]\\land\\forall b\\in E_+\\;([\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq b)]\\to r\\leq b)\">\\(\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}u(n)=r\\leftrightarrow r\\in E_+\\land[\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq r)]\\land\\forall b\\in E_+\\;([\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq b)]\\to r\\leq b)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}t(n)\">\\(\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}t(n)\\)</span> 使用函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle n,t(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle n,t(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>；只在各项属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_+\">\\(E_+\\)</span> 时使用。函数图及自然数分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>；本约定展开 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a> 的非负部分和约定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}outer\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu^*,\\mathcal P(X),[0,\\infty])\\land\\mu^*(\\varnothing)=0\\land\\forall A,B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to\\mu^*(A)\\leq\\mu^*(B))\\land\\forall A_\\bullet\\in\\mathcal P(X)^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mu^*\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A_\\bullet(n)\\right)\\leq\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu^*(A_\\bullet(n))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}outer\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu^*,\\mathcal P(X),[0,\\infty])\\land\\mu^*(\\varnothing)=0\\land\\forall A,B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to\\mu^*(A)\\leq\\mu^*(B))\\land\\forall A_\\bullet\\in\\mathcal P(X)^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mu^*\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A_\\bullet(n)\\right)\\leq\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu^*(A_\\bullet(n))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Outer measure: approximation from outside by covers; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu^*(E) = \\inf\">\\(\\mu^*(E) = \\inf\\)</span> sum of measures</li>\n<li>Carathéodory: sets splitting outer measure additively are measurable; Lebesgue measure</li>\n<li>Lebesgue outer: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^*(E) = \\inf\\{\\sum (b_i - a_i) : E \\subseteq \\bigcup (a_i, b_i)\\}\">\\(\\lambda^*(E) = \\inf\\{\\sum (b_i - a_i) : E \\subseteq \\bigcup (a_i, b_i)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Hausdorff: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^s\">\\(H^s\\)</span> outer measure via <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>-dimensional covers; fractal dimensions</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Halmos, Measure Theory</li>\n<li>Mattila, Geometry of Sets and Measures in Euclidean Spaces</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}t(n)$ 使用函数图 $\\{\\langle n,t(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}$；只在各项属于 $E_+$ 时使用。函数图及自然数分别见 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]、[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]；本约定展开 [[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]] 的非负部分和约定。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}t(n)$ 使用函数图 $\\{\\langle n,t(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}$；只在各项属于 $E_+$ 时使用。函数图及自然数分别见 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]、[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]；本约定展开 [[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]] 的非负部分和约定。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}t(n)$ 使用函数图 $\\{\\langle n,t(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}$；只在各项属于 $E_+$ 时使用。函数图及自然数分别见 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]、[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]；本约定展开 [[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]] 的非负部分和约定。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mu^*\\in\\mathbf V","display":false},{"tex":"[0,\\infty]\\coloneqq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"E_+\\coloneqq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty\\notin\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"E_+","display":false},{"tex":"a\\leq b\\leftrightarrow(b=\\infty\\lor(a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land a\\leq_{\\mathbb R}b))","display":false},{"tex":"a\\oplus b\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a+_{\\mathbb R}b,&a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\\\\\infty,&a=\\infty\\lor b=\\infty.\\end{cases}","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in E_+^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"p_u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(p_u,\\omega,E_+)\\land p_u(0)=0\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(n+1)=p_u(n)\\oplus u(n))","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}u(n)=r\\leftrightarrow r\\in E_+\\land[\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq r)]\\land\\forall b\\in E_+\\;([\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq b)]\\to r\\leq b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}t(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\langle n,t(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"E_+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}outer\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu^*,\\mathcal P(X),[0,\\infty])\\land\\mu^*(\\varnothing)=0\\land\\forall A,B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to\\mu^*(A)\\leq\\mu^*(B))\\land\\forall A_\\bullet\\in\\mathcal P(X)^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mu^*\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A_\\bullet(n)\\right)\\leq\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu^*(A_\\bullet(n))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu^*(E) = \\inf","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^*(E) = \\inf\\{\\sum (b_i - a_i) : E \\subseteq \\bigcup (a_i, b_i)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"H^s","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false}],"bytes":2488,"backlinks":[{"id":"eed77f2564d3480d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)$ (outer-measure predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md]])"},{"id":"d805ec13e8dbede3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)$ is the outer-measure predicate (see [[../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md]])"},{"id":"562a6df361969e1e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md]])."},{"id":"34cd9d26f03128ea","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S$ (outer-measure predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-outer-measure]])"},{"id"